# ============================================================================
# Tests: ivreg2 help-file worked examples.
# Generated by generate-helpfile-fixtures.do.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# COVERAGE LEDGER — all 55 distinct `ivreg2` invocations in the help file's
# Examples section (H01-H105), by home:
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# tested-here (griliches76, mroz, phillips, abdata, grunfeld, nlswork; 38
# commands, generate-helpfile-fixtures.do):
#   H03/H23, H04, H06, H07, H11, H13, H14, H16, H18, H20, H22, H25, H26, H27,
#   H28 (griliches, 15)
#   H31/H36, H33, H41/H46, H50, H54, H61, H66, H68 (mroz, 8)
#   H79, H80, H81 (phillips, 3)
#   H89, H90 (as bw=8), H91, H92 (as bw=8) (abdata, 4)
#   H95, H96, H97, H98, H99 (grunfeld, 5)
#   H103, H104, H105 (nlswork, 3)
#
# test-hols.R (empty-endogenous `(=z)` / HOLS syntax, ticket F3; 4 commands):
#   H34, H35, H48, H52 (mroz)
#
# test-ts-operators.R (formula-level `l()`/`d()` time-series operators,
# ticket F4; 9 commands):
#   H72, H73, H74, H75, H76 (klein)
#   H83, H84, H85 (phillips)
#   H88 (abdata)
#
# documented-error (help file itself is wrong; both Stata and R correctly
# reject the command; 3 commands, all fixtured as `capture` + `assert` in
# generate-helpfile-fixtures.do, no coef/vcov/diagnostics CSVs):
#   H29 (griliches: partial + gmm2s infeasible, 8 moments > 7 clusters)
#   H90, H92 (abdata: bw(9) exceeds the T=9 timespan; bw(8) is identical)
#
# external-package (5 commands, no ivreg2r equivalent):
#   H05 ivhettest, H24 overid, H32 ivendog, H82 newey, H100 xtscc
#
# Reconciliation with help-file-specs.md's 55 `ivreg2` command rows
# (42 "yes" + 4 "yes-F3" + 9 "yes-F4"): the 38 fixtures tested here cover
# 41 rows, because three fixtured commands are each shared by two H-rows
# (H03/H23; H31/H36 — savefirst is a Stata bookkeeping no-op; H41/H46).
# 41 + 4 (test-hols.R) + 9 (test-ts-operators.R) + 1 (H29, documented
# error, no fixture) = 55. H90/H92 are counted once, in the tested-here
# rows (fixtured at bw=8); their documented-error entries above record the
# rejection of the help file's literal bw(9), asserted in the .do file and
# in the expect_error tests below. The 5 external-package rows are not
# `ivreg2` commands and sit outside the 55.
# ============================================================================

